// Test: Parenthesized expressions
// Spec: 02-SYNTAX.md § 3.3 Parenthesized Expressions
// Priority: P0 - Bootstrap Critical
//
// Purpose:
// Validate parentheses affect operator precedence.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should print 20 ((2 + 3) * 4 = 20)

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !i32 = (2 + 3) * 4;
    println(x);
}
